<title>BELGIUM: EU sees 97/98 grain crop at 201.2 mln tns.</title>
<headline>EU sees 97/98 grain crop at 201.2 mln tns.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>European Union grain output is expected to rise slightly to 201.2 million tonnes in 1997/98 from 200.7 million tonnes in 1996/97, the European Commission's agriculture directorate general said in a market analysis on Wednesday.</p>
<p>It forecast wheat output rising to 99.7 million tonnes from 98.0 million tonnes over the same period. In the analysis presented by its agriculture director general Guy Legras.</p>
<p>The balance is made up of coarse grain production.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6800</p>
